# BUGS

The program isn't told of a new size; with no pty there is no SIGWINCH.
The modifiers held with an arrow or a function key are lost: rio's runes don't carry them.
The theme is the one in force when `vt` started.
The mouse isn't reported to the program, and there is no reflow of wrapped lines on a resize.
